      "html": "<section class=\"slide\" style=\"background:#0a0a12;color:#f5f5f7;padding:5cqi 7cqi\">\n    <p class=\"chr-kicker\" style=\"color:#ff8c5a\">One more thing</p>\n    <div class=\"c-row\" style=\"gap:6.58cqi;align-items:center\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1\">\n        <blockquote class=\"c-quote\" style=\"max-width:44ch;font-size:3.63cqi;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--font-display);color:#fff;padding-left:0\">&#x201C;I forgot I was wearing them. Then I remembered, and I didn&#39;t want to take them off.&#x201D;</blockquote>\n        <p class=\"c-body\" style=\"color:rgba(245,245,247,.72);margin-top:3.21cqi\">&mdash; Marques Lin, The Verge &middot; early review</p>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"flex:0 0 auto;text-align:center\">\n        <p class=\"c-body\" style=\"color:rgba(245,245,247,.5);margin-bottom:3.21cqi\">Ships May 14 &middot; from</p>\n        <div style=\"font-size:7.9cqi;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#fff\">$279</div>\n        <a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:1.65cqi 3.3cqi;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#ff5a36,#ff8c5a);color:#fff;font-weight:700;font-size:1.65cqi;text-decoration:none;margin-top:3.21cqi;box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(255,90,54,.4)\">Pre-order Halo v2 &rarr;</a>\n        <p class=\"c-body\" style=\"color:rgba(245,245,247,.5);margin-top:2.47cqi;font-size:1.07cqi\">Free shipping &middot; 45-day return &middot; 2-year warranty</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>"
